{"title":"2021 CEMC Gauss (Grade 7) Problems/Problem 1","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2021_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_7)_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>When the five numbers <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/9/9/499a5ed21b91860cdece2254f6200e3cdeddfce6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$10~000$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"53\" height=\"14\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/c/e/dce34f4dfb2406144304ad0d6106c5382ddd1446.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/c/6/fc606f7f1e530731ab4f1cc364c01dc64a4455ee.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$10$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/5/9/e59e2c6e83eb78cca610a5fd4070ae01c8d4ae60.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$100$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"29\" height=\"14\" />, and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/e/e/6ee927e1332358c96c62c277441c907c4f51057f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1000$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"38\" height=\"14\" /> are arranged from largest to smallest, the middle number is\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/3/7/637262f43ff7bfe133bb6e9ceb5a5b31231b81e8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A)}\\ 10~000 \\qquad\\textbf{(B)}\\ 1 \\qquad\\textbf{(C)}\\ 10 \\qquad\\textbf{(D)}\\ 100 \\qquad\\textbf{(E)}\\ 1000$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"447\" height=\"18\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2021_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_7)_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Arranging the numbers from greatest to least, we have:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/a/2/ea25601ece07c21857bb2b6dcc26a7cbee2aa93a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$10~000, 1000, 100, 10, 1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"176\" height=\"17\" />\n</p><p>We then see that the middle number is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/1/1/c11b440d2024964022e1ef6a8b3e9625f95f2327.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\textbf {(D) } 100}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"76\" height=\"30\" />.\n</p><p>~anabel.disher and CEMC\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\"Solution_2_.28No_Arranging.29\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_2_(No_Arranging)\">Solution 2 (No Arranging)</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2021_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_7)_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 2 (No Arranging)\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>We can see that there are <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/9/0/79069377f91364c2f87a64e5f9f562a091c8a6c1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$5$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> numbers and half of that would be <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/c/9/6c91cd53e1a02e0e55bc00fb4293d07c110bdde2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{5}{2} = 2.5$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"62\" height=\"38\" />. The middle number would then be the <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/c/d/7cde695f2e4542fd01f860a89189f47a27143b66.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /><sup>rd</sup> greatest number, which is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/1/1/c11b440d2024964022e1ef6a8b3e9625f95f2327.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\textbf {(D) } 100}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"76\" height=\"30\" />.\n</p><p>~anabel.disher\n</p>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2021_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_7)\" title=\"2021 CEMC Gauss (Grade 7)\">2021 CEMC Gauss (Grade 7)</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2021_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_7)_Problems&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2021 CEMC Gauss (Grade 7) Problems (page does not exist)\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2021_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_7)_Answer_Key&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2021 CEMC Gauss (Grade 7) Answer Key (page does not exist)\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://cemc.math.uwaterloo.ca/contests/past_contests.html\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b>First Problem</b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2021_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_7)_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"2021 CEMC Gauss (Grade 7) Problems/Problem 2\">Problem 2</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2021_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_7)_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"2021 CEMC Gauss (Grade 7) Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2021_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_7)_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"2021 CEMC Gauss (Grade 7) Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2021_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_7)_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"2021 CEMC Gauss (Grade 7) Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2021_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_7